# Force LF in the repo and on checkout. Railway runs Linux, and a Dockerfile
# or shell script that picks up CRLF from a Windows checkout fails in ways
# that are hard to read (this bit us on the Dockerfile once already).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must not touch.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
